<title>USA: Waxman says CFO to resign.</title>
<headline>Waxman says CFO to resign.</headline>
<dateline>BEDFORD HEIGHTS, Ohio 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Waxman Industries Inc said on Friday Michael J. Vantusko, chief financial officer, will resign effective December 31 to pursue other career opportunities.</p>
<p>Mark W. Wester, who joined the company in October as the Corporate Controller, will assume the vice president-finance position effective January 1, Waxman said.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
